[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0480","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12705","title":"ISC BIND 9 DNS-over-HTTPS 资源耗尽漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 9 的 DNS-over-HTTPS（DoH）实现存在资源耗尽漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标 DNS 解析器发送大量特制的有效或无效 HTTP/2 流量，耗尽服务器 CPU 和内存资源，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 BIND 9.18.0 至 9.18.32、9.20.0 至 9.20.4、9.21.0 至 9.21.3 及对应 S1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12705"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T22:15:28.800","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:18.683","remediation":"将 BIND 9 升级至修复版本：9.18.x 系列升级至 9.18.33，9.20.x 系列升级至 9.20.5，9.21.x 系列升级至 9.21.4；BIND 9 支持预览版 (SPE) 升级至 9.18.33-S1。如业务中未使用 DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) 功能，可在 named.conf 中移除或注释掉 DoH 监听器配置作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.isc.org/docs/cve-2024-12705","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250207-0003/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12705.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12705.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12705.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-12705","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12705.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/isc/gb_bind_CVE-2024-12705_lin.nasl","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/bind/APKBUILD","https://github.com/ctrliq/advisories/blob/b05bfbc3a1de170377430c48777435c2cc639f64/csaf/vex/cve/2024/cve-2024-12705.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/af921e515cd7cbfe18b16cbe5ccc1188e05dcb47/references/contrib1-CVE-2024-12705-2025-02-07-1605","https://github.com/flatcar/scripts/blob/0d33c8931a17f17eee34f33b0f3dc6c6b8cf35b0/changelog/security/2025-06-23-weekly-updates.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0468","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0468.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11187","title":"ISC BIND 9 DNS 附加记录CPU耗尽漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 9 的 DNS 解析组件存在 CPU 资源耗尽漏洞，攻击者可构造包含大量附加记录（Additional section）的恶意 DNS 区域，当查询该区域时，权威服务器或独立解析器在处理响应时会产生大量额外记录，导致 CPU 资源被过度消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 BIND 9 多个版本系列（9.11 至 9.21），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需预先构造恶意区域并诱导目标服务器查询，无需认证即可远程触发。建议升级至已修复版本或应用厂商安全补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11187"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T22:15:28.637","updated":"2026-06-17T06:57:14.430","remediation":"立即升级 BIND 9 至修复版本：9.18.33、9.20.5 或 9.21.4（BIND SPE 用户升级至 9.18.33-S1）。如无法立即升级，可在 named.conf 的 options 块中添加 `minimal-responses yes;` 作为临时缓解措施，限制 DNS 响应中附加记录数量以降低 CPU 耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.isc.org/docs/cve-2024-11187","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00011.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250207-0002/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2024/CVE-2024-11187.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11187.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11187.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-11187","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-11187.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/isc/gb_bind_CVE-2024-11187_lin.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2024-11187-2025-02-11-1805","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-11187.json","https://github.com/flatcar/scripts/blob/0d33c8931a17f17eee34f33b0f3dc6c6b8cf35b0/changelog/security/2025-06-23-weekly-updates.md","https://github.com/isc-projects/bind9/blob/b443224f8937d66e5aa489a64ce4939ab72d7a32/doc/changelog/changelog-9.21.4.rst"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0468.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0513","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45341","title":"Go crypto/x509 IPv6 区域 ID URI 名称限制绕过漏洞","description":"GoLang 的 crypto/x509 证书验证库中存在安全漏洞，当证书的 URI 中包含带有区域 ID（Zone ID）的 IPv6 地址时，攻击者可通过构造特制证书绕过 URI 名称约束（Name Constraints）检查，导致非预期域名或路径被信任。由于公共 Web PKI 不允许使用含 URI 的证书，该漏洞仅影响使用私有 PKI 且启用 URI 名称约束的场景，攻击者利用该漏洞可导致中间人攻击或证书验证绕过，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45341"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-28T02:15:29.147","updated":"2026-06-17T07:54:03.920","remediation":"升级 Go 至 1.22.11、1.23.5 或 1.24.0-rc.2 及以上版本，其中修复了 crypto/x509 对含 IPv6 区域 ID 的 URI 名称约束校验逻辑。如使用 NetApp 产品，请参考 NTAP-20250221-0004 安装对应安全更新。无法立即升级时，避免在私有 PKI 的 URI 中使用含区域 ID 的 IPv6 地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://go.dev/cl/643099","https://go.dev/issue/71156","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-dev/c/CAWXhan3Jww/m/bk9LAa-lCgAJ","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-dev/c/bG8cv1muIBM/m/G461hA6lCgAJ","https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-3373","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250221-0004/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45341.md","https://github.com/hashicorp/consul/blob/afbfd4afadcbdb9973025bce0101bbc5c42ac4dd/.changelog/22084.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45341.json","https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/blob/10b68716e53644a8fa0cbbaf156bf67ef93a017d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/docker/docs/blob/d19a384f8dd3b16ab3a4b5f3885b398e76f8638c/content/manuals/engine/release-notes/27.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45341.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-45341","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45341.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-45341-2025-02-21-1705","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/community/go/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0513.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0512","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45339","title":"Golang glog 日志文件符号链接漏洞","description":"golang glog 日志库在创建日志文件时存在安全漏洞，当日志文件写入可被广泛写入的目录（默认配置）时，低权限攻击者可预测高权限进程的日志文件路径，并提前创建指向敏感文件的符号链接。当高权限进程运行时，会跟随该符号链接覆盖目标敏感文件，导致权限提升或敏感数据破坏。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，影响所有使用 glog 默认配置的 Go 应用。修复方式为在检测到日志文件已存在时程序退出（状态码 2），防止符号链接攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45339"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-28T02:15:28.927","updated":"2026-06-17T07:54:03.643","remediation":"立即将 github.com/golang/glog 升级到 v1.2.4 及以上版本，该版本在检测到日志文件已存在时直接退出（退出码 2），防止符号链接劫持。如无法升级，应将日志输出目录改为非全局可写路径，并确保日志目录权限为 750 或更严格，仅允许运行进程的用户写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/golang/glog/pull/74","https://github.com/golang/glog/pull/74/commits/b8741656e406e66d6992bc2c9575e460ecaa0ec2","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/H-Q4ouHWyKs","https://owasp.org/www-community/vulnerabilities/Insecure_Temporary_File","https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-3372","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00019.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45339.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45339.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45339.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45339","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/golang/glog/CVE-2024-45339.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45339.json","https://github.com/IBM/portieris/blob/6eaaacaed7ba53af3002726fc0a25b5e5e1e2de0/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-45339-2025-02-17-1005","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-45339.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/05da64c166d4f0c1282a01018eb34f5a34c00175/data/reports/GO-2025-3372.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0511","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45336","title":"Go net/http 跨域重定向敏感标头信息泄露漏洞","description":"Go 语言 net/http 包在处理 HTTP 客户端重定向时存在安全漏洞。当客户端向 a.com 发送包含 Authorization 等敏感标头的请求，经过跨域重定向到 b.com 后，敏感标头本应被丢弃，但在后续同域重定向链（如 a.com → b.com/1 → b.com/2）中，敏感标头会被错误地恢复并发送到 b.com/2，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者可利用精心构造的重定向链窃取用户凭据，影响使用 Go net/http 标准库的应用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45336"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-28T02:15:28.807","updated":"2026-06-17T07:54:03.217","remediation":"升级 Go 至 1.22.11、1.23.5 或 1.24.0-rc.2 及以上版本，这些版本已修复跨域重定向后敏感标头被错误恢复的问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对重定向链中的目标域名做白名单校验，避免敏感标头发往不可信域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://go.dev/cl/643100","https://go.dev/issue/70530","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-dev/c/CAWXhan3Jww/m/bk9LAa-lCgAJ","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-dev/c/bG8cv1muIBM/m/G461hA6lCgAJ","https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-3420","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250221-0003/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45336.md","https://github.com/hashicorp/consul/blob/afbfd4afadcbdb9973025bce0101bbc5c42ac4dd/.changelog/22084.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45336.json","https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/blob/10b68716e53644a8fa0cbbaf156bf67ef93a017d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45336.json","https://github.com/docker/docs/blob/d19a384f8dd3b16ab3a4b5f3885b398e76f8638c/content/manuals/engine/release-notes/27.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-45336","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45336.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-45336-2025-02-21-1705","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45336.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0511.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0469","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11218","title":"Podman 和 Buildah 容器构建竞争条件容器突破漏洞","description":"Podman 和 Buildah 容器引擎在并行构建容器镜像时存在竞争条件漏洞，当使用 `--jobs=2` 参数构建恶意 Containerfile 时，攻击者可利用时间窗口绕过容器隔离机制实现容器逃逸，枚举主机文件系统中的文件和目录信息。该漏洞影响 Podman 及 Buildah 多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。即使启用 SELinux 也无法完全阻止文件信息泄露，建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11218"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-22T05:15:08.903","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:29.563","remediation":"将 buildah 升级至 1.33.12、1.35.5、1.37.6 或 1.38.1 及以上版本（各分支修复版本）。Red Hat 用户请安装 RHSA-2025:0830 及后续相关 errata 更新。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施包括：避免对不可信的 Containerfile 使用 --jobs=2 及以上并行构建参数，并启用 SELinux  enforcing 模式（虽不能完全阻止枚举，但可降低容器逃逸影响）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0830","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0878","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0922","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0923","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1186","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1187","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1188","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1189","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1207","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1275","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1295","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1296","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1372","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1453","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1707","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1713","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1908","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1910","https://access.redhat.com/e